  "description": "Ethan Yoon is a rising star researcher at the pharmaceutical giant Neurix until he is kidnapped on his commute. The demand from gang boss Ramon Garcia is simple: synthesize Exidrine, the deadly drug Ethan engineered. Forced to work as an unwilling chemist, Ethan risks everything on a desperate break for freedom, only to end up staring down the barrel of a gun. Just as the trigger is about to be pulled, a mysterious stranger crashes in to save his life. With his savior demanding to know if he truly created the drug, Ethan finds himself dragged out of one trap and straight into an even deadlier firefight.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
